---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Nikhil Shetty"
  description="Networking and interconnect for large GPU clusters — standards work and a book in progress."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__head">
      <img
        class="hero__photo"
        src="/nikhil-shetty.jpg"
        alt=""
        width="140"
        height="140"
      />
      <h1 class="hero__name">Nikhil Shetty</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__bio">
      <p>
        I'm a technical lead in AI infrastructure networking, specializing in
        cloud infrastructure, observability, and control planes. With more than
        16 years of experience across startups, network switch vendors, and
        cloud infrastructure, I bring a practitioner's perspective to the design
        of cloud-scale platforms.
      </p>
      <p>
        My current work centers on high-performance networking and accelerator
        interconnects for GPU clusters, where I lead initiatives ranging from
        tuning network performance for distributed training workloads to
        introducing novel network fabrics in the cloud.
      </p>
      <p>
        I contribute to interconnect standards through OCP and the Ultra
        Ethernet Consortium, and I have a Ph.D. in EECS from UC Berkeley.
        Based in Santa Clara, California.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="band__head">
      <h2>Book</h2>
      <span class="band__more"><a href="/book/">Details and updates</a></span>
    </div>
    <div class="book">
      <p class="book__title">High-Performance AI Systems</p>
      <p class="book__sub">Engineering Hyperscale GPU Clusters</p>
      <p class="book__body">
        A book for engineers who have to make large GPU clusters work, written
        with Rik Kisnah and published by Packt. In progress.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
